# House Tools — agent workflow

Static catalog site. Tool content is data-driven; most HTML is generated at build time.

## Edit these files

| Task | Files |
|------|-------|
| Add or update a tool | `data/tools.json` |
| Newsletter slug | `data/site.json` |
| Homepage layout (header, filters shell, footer) | `index.template.html` |
| Catalog UI / filters / signup JS | `app.js` |
| Styles | `styles.css` |
| Page generation logic | `scripts/build-pages.mjs` |

## After changing JSON or templates

Run `npm run build` (or `npm start`, which builds then serves).

## Do not edit

- `index.html` — generated from `index.template.html` + `data/tools.json`
- `tools/*/index.html` — generated tool PDPs
- `kits/essentials/index.html` — generated essentials kit page
- `sitemap.xml` — generated

## Adding a tool

1. Add an entry to `data/tools.json` (`id` must be lowercase slug; `tags` must match filter pills in `app.js`).
2. Run `npm run build`.
3. Do not hand-edit generated HTML.
